{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421534001:1":{"text":"……これ、提出に来ました！","source_cn":"我们来提交作品了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F414CA904F8A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421534002:1":{"text":"やっと来たか！ふむ……ヴェインの剣は刃の鋭さも、柄の彫刻の趣も、どれも素晴らしい。そして……この完璧な重さの調整、見事だ！","source_cn":"就差你们了！我来看看瓦恩的作品——剑锋飒沓锐利！剑柄雕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6FE962C89E370C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421534003:1":{"text":"ヴェイン……君は本当に、自分自身を超えたんだな。","source_cn":"瓦恩，看来你真的突破了你自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD75D135B2F62F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421534004:1":{"text":"それでは、予選を突破した職人を発表します――ヴェイン、テゴダ！","source_cn":"我宣布，你和铁哥达是唯二通过淘汰赛考验的工匠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2730E4E3A6B946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421534005:1":{"text":"テゴダ？","source_cn":"铁哥达？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF93F357CF2D491E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421534006:1":{"text":"ハガルドさんの弟子か……まさか、この大会に参加していたなんて……","source_cn":"是铁须的徒弟……原来他也参加这次的锻魂大赛了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x276174D652842280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421534007:1":{"text":"この鍛魂大会のチャンピオンは、この二人の最終決戦によって決まります！","source_cn":"铁哥达和瓦恩，本届锻魂大赛的冠军将通过接下来的最终比试...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB39322563141AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421534008:1":{"text":"ヴェイン！？まさか、最後の相手が君になるなんてな。","source_cn":"瓦恩？！真没想到最后的对手是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71867B2D459D2516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421534009:1":{"text":"テゴダ……そっちにいるのは……？","source_cn":"铁哥达……还有你身边这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD62CE19D06A473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421534010:1":{"text":"ああ、彼は傭兵仲間のスラルグさ。実戦テストのために、わざわざオルディン村まで来てくれたんだ。","source_cn":"这是我在外认识的佣兵朋友斯拉格，他为了帮我试剑特意坐很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x811820F14A3902E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421534011:1":{"text":"今回、師匠の助言ももちろん役に立ったが……","source_cn":"这次比赛里，师父的建议帮了我很多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689E6ABDEF8BAC1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421534012:1":{"text":"最終的に俺を突き動かしたのは、スラルグの相棒となる剣を作りたいという想いだった。","source_cn":"但最终是为斯拉格锻造一把趁手的好武器的决心让我通过了考验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A5D492F644940C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421534013:1":{"text":"剣、テゴダ、いいぞ！","source_cn":"剑，铁哥达，好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B928DBF498128C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421534014:1":{"text":"最終決戦……かかってこい、俺は負けないぞ！","source_cn":"最终比试……尽管来吧，我可不会怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F25A0E0AF5793F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421534015:1":{"text":"最終決戦では、こちらのスタッフが二人の武器を使い、実戦形式で性能を競います。そして、勝者の使用した武器が今年のチャンピオンソードとなります！","source_cn":"最终比试是对你们锻造的武器进行实战测试，将会有两名工作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB264CEC939FD7F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421534016:1":{"text":"ロンロンがやってもいいですか？ヴェインさんの剣で戦いたいです！","source_cn":"满满想要报名参赛！我想用瓦恩锻造的剑战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA699168F13322AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1421534017:1":{"text":"ハムスター、我、相手なる。","source_cn":"仓鼠，我，迎战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C086B0999CBB053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1421534018:1":{"text":"二人とも……いいでしょう。なんて胸が熱くなる決戦なんだ！","source_cn":"你们想亲自来吗……好吧。真是一场激昂澎湃的决战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BACCB1FAE030DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1421534019:1":{"text":"ただし、重要なのは戦い方ではなく、武器の性能そのものですからね。","source_cn":"记住，比拼的不是你们的战斗技巧，而是你们手中的武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2910C00786C719B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1421534020:1":{"text":"それでは、ただ今より――最終決戦、開始！","source_cn":"现在我宣布，最终比试正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89372B31B69D3DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:锻魂大赛主持人":{"text":"大会の司会者","source":"锻魂大赛主持人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦恩":{"text":"ヴェイン","source":"瓦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学徒铁哥达":{"text":"弟子のテゴダ","source":"学徒铁哥达